## Ported material: HanaAgent / openhanako

This project is a visual port of **HanaAgent (openhanako)**,
<https://github.com/liliMozi/openhanako>, which is licensed under the
**Apache License, Version 2.0** (a copy is included in
licenses/Apache-2.0.txt).

Ported / derived material includes:

- theme palettes and design tokens derived from `desktop/src/themes/*.css`
  (source for `src/themes.generated.json` and the bundled themes);
- the HanaUI settings-page layout, section structure and control styling;
- the StepSlider control and the sunny-mode procedural tree-shadow renderer
  (reimplemented function-by-function from the upstream build);
- paper texture images (`lib/assets/paper-*.png`).

The upstream code and assets remain the property of the openhanako
contributors and are used under the terms of the Apache License 2.0.
No endorsement by the openhanako project is claimed.

## Ported material: desktop icon sync mechanism

The Windows desktop app-icon sync in `lib/app-icon.js` (shortcut scan/backup,
start-menu refresh parking, `SHChangeNotify` and the `WM_SETICON` window-icon
helper) is adapted from **@smalltailqwq/dsh-client-ui-skin-deep-whale-manager**,
<https://github.com/Small-tailqwq/dsh-deep-whale>, which is licensed under the
**MIT License**, Copyright (c) 2026 Small-tailqwq (a copy is included in
licenses/dsh-deep-whale-manager-MIT.txt). HanaUI adapted it from "follow the
active skin" to a per-icon selection with its own icon assets and state file.
